{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/lem-staircase-corner-hook","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Lemma","doco:Section"],"label":"lem:staircase-corner-hook","kind":"lemma","title":"Staircase corner hook $h_{\\mathrm{corner}}(\\rho_k) = 2k - 1$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-staircase-partition"],"cites":["references/stanley1999"],"tags":["staircase-partition","hook-length","corner-cell","combinatorial-lemma","ew-residual"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.StaircaseCornerHook.staircase_corner_hook_eq_two_k_sub_one","text":"staircase-corner-hook.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"lem:staircase-corner-hook\"></a><p><em>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_k = (k, k-1, \\dots, 1)</code> be the staircase partition, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\geq 1</code>. Its corner cell <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(0, 0)</code> has <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{arm}(0,0) = k - 1</code> (row <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">0</code> has <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code> cells) and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{leg}(0,0) = k - 1</code> (there are <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code> rows). The corner hook is therefore</em></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  h_{\\mathrm{corner}}(\\rho_k)\n  \\;=\\; (k - 1) + (k - 1) + 1\n  \\;=\\; 2k - 1.</code></pre>\n<p><em>The formal statement is the final arithmetic step, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(k-1) + (k-1) + 1 = 2k - 1</code> in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{N}</code> for <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k \\geq 1</code>; the arm and leg values are read off the shape of <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\rho_k</code> directly from the staircase Young diagram.</em></p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/staircase-corner-hook.md","heading":"Lemma","number":"13.2.13","page":"b/lem-staircase-corner-hook","qa":{"counts":{"pass":91,"fail":1,"warn":4,"na":23,"unknown":0,"stale":89},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:BraidKnotOctonion.StaircaseCornerHook.staircase_corner_hook_eq_two_k_sub_one","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/BraidKnotOctonion/StaircaseCornerHook.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
